What Are Parylene Coatings?
Parylene coatings represent a class of ultra-thin, conformal polymer films applied through a unique vapor deposition process. Unlike conventional coatings, Parylene forms pinhole-free protective layers that offer superior moisture resistance, dielectric properties, and chemical inertness. These characteristics make them ideal for protecting sensitive electronic components, medical implants, and aerospace equipment where failure isn't an option.
